Hi, I found a new little bug
the parts highlighted in yellow should only come out if you have the commander active. For now I have fixed partially the error

![image](https://github.com/ogamespec/ogame-opensource/assets/5828819/61b29961-76d1-474c-baf0-acf7e291d52d)

in galaxy.php at line 690 (around) these lines:
```php
if ($aktplanet["f210"] > 0) echo "<span id="probes">".nicenum($aktplanet["f210"])."</span> Sonde spia &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;";
    if ($aktplanet["f209"] > 0) echo "<span id="recyclers">".nicenum($aktplanet["f209"])."</span> Riciclatrici  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;";
    if ($aktplanet["d503"] > 0) echo "<span id="missiles">".nicenum($aktplanet["d503"])."</span> Missili interplanetari  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;";
```

REPLACE WITH:

```php
if($prem['commander']) {

    if ($aktplanet["f210"] > 0) echo "<span id="probes">".nicenum($aktplanet["f210"])."</span> Sonde spia &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;";
    if ($aktplanet["f209"] > 0) echo "<span id="recyclers">".nicenum($aktplanet["f209"])."</span> Riciclatrici  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;";
    if ($aktplanet["d503"] > 0) echo "<span id="missiles">".nicenum($aktplanet["d503"])."</span> Missili interplanetari  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;";
    }else{ echo "";}
```

it should also be applied for deuterium and fleet slots but I'm trying to understand how to do it since the lines below are written differently
